        "text": "You are an expert ATS (Applicant Tracking System) resume parser.\n\nAnalyze the attached resume image carefully and extract only genuine candidate information.\n\nIgnore:\n- decorative text\n- lorem ipsum\n- placeholder content\n- fake sample text\n- background design elements\n- icons\n- graphics\n- watermarks\n\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON object.\n\nDo not include markdown, code fences, explanations, comments, or any extra text.\n\nUse exactly this schema:\n\n{\n  \"full_name\": \"string\",\n  \"email\": \"string\",\n  \"phone\": \"string\",\n  \"location\": \"string\",\n  \"current_role\": \"string\",\n  \"total_experience_years\": 0,\n  \"skills\": [],\n  \"education\": \"string\",\n  \"certifications\": [],\n  \"projects\": [],\n  \"companies_worked\": [],\n  \"key_achievements\": \"string\",\n  \"candidate_summary\": \"string\"\n}\n\nRules:\n\n- Extract only information that is clearly visible in the resume.\n- Never invent or guess missing information.\n- If a field is missing use:\n  - \"Not specified\" for text\n  - 0 for numbers\n  - [] for arrays\n- If any text looks like lorem ipsum, placeholder text, fake content or meaningless sample text, ignore it and return \"Not specified\".\n- Return only the JSON object.",
        "inputType": "binary",
        "binaryPropertyName": "attachment_0",
        "options": {}
      },
